questions.enonce_markdown:
Mr Ngu borrows CFAF 1,800,000 from a bank for 2 years at a simple interest rate of 12% per year. Calculate:

i) the interest for one year;

ii) the total interest for the 2 years;

iii) the total amount that Mr Ngu must repay;

iv) the monthly instalment, if the total amount is repaid in 24 equal monthly instalments.
